WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:15.933
Maggie heard Henry and came running over.

2
00:00:15.934 --> 00:00:20.359
"I knew it!" she cried. "It was Rebecca, wasn't it?"

3
00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:28.815
"Hold on," Henry said. "I need to find one last bit of evidence."

4
00:00:28.816 --> 00:00:35.328
Henry ducked into Big Spot's stall and felt around in the bedding until he found something.

5
00:00:35.329 --> 00:00:39.476
Then he hurried out of the stall and down the aisle—right past Rebecca.

6
00:00:39.477 --> 00:00:41.897
Maggie and Cole rushed after him.

7
00:00:41.898 --> 00:00:44.658
"What's going on?" Maggie demanded.

8
00:00:44.659 --> 00:00:49.957
Henry stopped and quickly told her about how Cole had put the lollipop in Daisy's shirt.

9
00:00:49.958 --> 00:00:54.711
Maggie looked confused. "So Cole is the shirt thief?"

10
00:00:54.712 --> 00:00:57.174
"Not exactly," Henry said.

11
00:00:57.175 --> 00:01:00.999
"But he's the one who caused the shirt to get stolen."

12
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:05.730
"I did?" Cole sounded just as confused as Maggie. "How?"

13
00:01:05.731 --> 00:01:11.596
Henry smiled. "By putting that lollipop in the wrong shirt pocket!"

14
00:01:11.597 --> 00:01:14.408
"Huh?" Cole said.

15
00:01:14.409 --> 00:01:18.070
Henry spotted Daisy and Kira near the lemonade stand.

16
00:01:18.071 --> 00:01:21.590
"Where have you guys been?" Daisy complained.

17
00:01:21.591 --> 00:01:27.356
"We're thirsty. Plus it's getting late. Have you solved the case yet?"

18
00:01:27.357 --> 00:01:30.892
"The case?" Kira said. "What case?"

19
00:01:30.893 --> 00:01:35.713
Daisy shrugged. "Haven't you ever heard of The Lemonade Detectives?

20
00:01:35.714 --> 00:01:38.631
I asked them to find my missing shirt."

21
00:01:38.632 --> 00:01:42.193
"You guys are detectives?" Kira stared at Henry.

22
00:01:42.194 --> 00:01:45.257
"Is that why you were asking me questions earlier?"

23
00:01:45.258 --> 00:01:48.430
"Yes." Henry noticed that Kira looked pale.

24
00:01:48.431 --> 00:01:51.537
"Is there anything you want to tell Daisy?"

25
00:01:51.538 --> 00:01:55.884
Kira took a deep breath. "I do have something to say, Daisy.

26
00:01:55.885 --> 00:02:00.132
It wasn't your shirt that got ruined. It was mine!"

27
00:02:00.133 --> 00:02:02.697
"What?" Daisy exclaimed.

28
00:02:02.698 --> 00:02:05.422
"What?" Maggie shrieked.

29
00:02:05.423 --> 00:02:07.692
"Huh?" Cole said.

30
00:02:07.693 --> 00:02:11.412
"Just let Kira explain," Henry told them.

31
00:02:11.413 --> 00:02:16.512
"It all started when Cole put a lollipop in the pocket of the wrong shirt."

32
00:02:16.513 --> 00:02:19.038
Daisy shot a look at Cole.

33
00:02:19.039 --> 00:02:22.809
"I was trying to surprise Daisy," Cole mumbled.

34
00:02:22.810 --> 00:02:25.923
"I didn't know you two had matching shirts."

35
00:02:25.924 --> 00:02:29.655
Daisy smiled. "Aw, that's sweet.

36
00:02:29.656 --> 00:02:33.641
It almost makes me wish I had a little brother like you!"

37
00:02:33.642 --> 00:02:35.186
Cole looked away.

38
00:02:35.187 --> 00:02:39.423
Henry guessed that Cole didn't like having Daisy treat him like a little brother.

39
00:02:39.424 --> 00:02:43.752
"Kira's stall is right next to Big Spot's," Henry said.

40
00:02:43.753 --> 00:02:48.944
"Close enough for Big Spot to grab Kira's shirt when he smelled that candy."

41
00:02:48.945 --> 00:02:55.724
Kira nodded. "When I came into the barn earlier, Spot was chewing on my shirt." She looked away.

42
00:02:55.725 --> 00:02:59.564
"My parents are already mad at me for spending so much money on it.

43
00:02:59.565 --> 00:03:02.904
I knew they'd be even angrier if the shirt got ruined.

44
00:03:02.905 --> 00:03:06.282
I rinsed out most of the horse slobber in the water trough.

45
00:03:06.283 --> 00:03:08.415
But I couldn't get the blue stain out."

46
00:03:08.416 --> 00:03:10.941
She ducked her head, looking ashamed.

47
00:03:10.942 --> 00:03:14.428
"I left my shirt in the water trough and ran inside.

48
00:03:14.429 --> 00:03:20.398
Daisy wasn't around, so I grabbed her shirt and put it on so everyone would think it was mine."

49
00:03:20.399 --> 00:03:26.757
"That explains why you've been wearing your show coat all day despite the heat," Henry guessed.

50
00:03:26.758 --> 00:03:28.945
Kira pulled off her coat.

51
00:03:28.946 --> 00:03:33.033
"I didn't want anyone to notice and figure out the truth," she admitted.

52
00:03:33.034 --> 00:03:38.229
"This stick explains how Big Spot got blue slobber on Maggie's shirt."

53
00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:42.238
Henry held up the empty lollipop stick he'd found in the pony's stall.

54
00:03:42.239 --> 00:03:45.557
"This was all that was left of that lollipop."

55
00:03:45.558 --> 00:03:48.784
Kira's eyes filled with tears as she turned to Daisy.

56
00:03:48.785 --> 00:03:52.474
"I'm sorry. Can you ever forgive me?"

57
00:03:52.475 --> 00:03:56.841
Daisy didn't say anything for a second. Then she sighed.

58
00:03:56.842 --> 00:04:00.631
"I guess it's partly my fault too," she said.

59
00:04:00.632 --> 00:04:07.897
"I practically forced you to buy that expensive shirt. I'm sorry. Friends?"

60
00:04:07.898 --> 00:04:11.629
"Friends." Kira smiled with relief.

61
00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:16.738
She and Daisy hugged. Then they linked arms and started walking away.

62
00:04:16.739 --> 00:04:18.885
Suddenly Daisy turned back.

63
00:04:18.886 --> 00:04:22.827
"I almost forgot," she said, digging into her pocket.

64
00:04:22.828 --> 00:04:27.385
"Here's your detective fee. Thanks for solving the case."

65
00:04:27.386 --> 00:04:33.368
"You're welcome." Maggie took the money and put it in the cashbox.

66
00:04:33.369 --> 00:04:38.313
"You don't look very excited, Maggie," said Henry. "What's wrong?"

67
00:04:38.314 --> 00:04:42.258
"I wanted to enter more classes in the show," Maggie said.

68
00:04:42.259 --> 00:04:46.292
"But I still don't have enough money." She sighed.

69
00:04:46.293 --> 00:04:50.753
"That's okay, though. I'll just keep saving money until the next show."

70
00:04:50.754 --> 00:04:54.223
Henry was surprised that Maggie was acting so mature.

71
00:04:54.224 --> 00:04:58.574
He traded a look with Cole. Then he grabbed the cashbox.

72
00:04:58.575 --> 00:05:01.736
"Here," he said, handing it to Maggie.

73
00:05:01.737 --> 00:05:04.748
"This should be enough to enter more classes."

74
00:05:04.749 --> 00:05:09.313
"Huh?" Maggie said. "But only a third of that money is mine."

75
00:05:09.314 --> 00:05:11.918
"Not today," Henry said.

76
00:05:11.919 --> 00:05:14.357
Cole nodded. "Take it, Maggie."

77
00:05:14.358 --> 00:05:21.738
"Wow, thanks!" Maggie grabbed the cash and took off toward the barn.

78
00:05:21.739 --> 00:05:24.899
"Just don't get used to it!" Cole called after her.

79
00:05:24.900 --> 00:05:29.762
"Next time it's back to splitting the cash three ways."

80
00:05:29.763 --> 00:05:34.386
Henry laughed. "I guess that's another case closed."

81
00:05:34.387 --> 00:05:38.141
He pointed to a bunch of thirsty-looking riders heading their way.

82
00:05:38.142 --> 00:05:46.803
"Time to go back to selling lemonade."
